  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8eb37102d2241c54eae4db6c08bbb7c5, type: 3}
  m_Name: swift
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PrincesPalace.Core::PrincesPalace.Content.ModifierDefinition
  id: swift
  displayName: Swift
  description: 'Phase D1''s dodge family. A step too quick for a swing or a cast
    to reliably land -- Magnitude is a flat percent chance, rolled fresh against
    every real attack the wearer is the target of, to make the whole thing miss outright
    (see ModifierEffectType.DodgeChancePercent and DamagePipeline.RollDodge for the
    full mechanics: zero damage, and every on-hit rider skipped with it). Base 12%
    at Ordinary/tier-0 is deliberately modest -- TierMultiplier alone reaches roughly
    9x by tier 10, and a percent-chance effect has a hard ceiling a flat-damage effect
    does not, so a high base here would race toward ''always dodges'' long before
    a Fiery or Vampiric counterpart reaches its own comparable power; see DamagePipeline.RollDodge''s
    own note on the >=100 clamp this relies on as a backstop, not a design target.'
  effects:
  - type: 15
    magnitude: 12
    threshold: 0
    against: 0
    hasAgainst: 0
    againstMagical: 0
  sortOrder: 11
